   "in_list_view": 1,
   "in_standard_filter": 1,
   "description": "Active: offered to dealers and staff in ERPNext and the portal, not listed on the website. Active + Live: offered the same way and listed on the website through its Webflow Product, which must be linked first. Internal Only: offered to staff only, hidden from dealers and the website. New templates start Internal Only. Draft, Discontinued and Archived are not offered."
